              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ছিদ্র — chhidrô — \"a hole; a small opening\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "নৌকার তলায় একটা ছিদ্র ছিল। Noukār tôlāy ekṭā chhidrô chhilô. There was a hole in the bottom of the boat."
